#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Setup instructions for using IBM Quantum on IBM Cloud to submit Qiskit SDK "
"and Qiskit Runtime jobs by using the REST API"
msgstr ""
"Mga tagubilin sa pag-set up ng IBM Quantum sa IBM Cloud para magsumite ng "
"mga Qiskit SDK at Qiskit Runtime na trabaho gamit ang REST API"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up to use IBM Quantum Platform with REST API"
msgstr "I-set up ang paggamit ng IBM Quantum Platform gamit ang REST API"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore urlendcoded, WQVY */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore urlendcoded, WQVY */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up to use IBM Quantum Platform with REST API {#set-up-to-use-ibm-"
"quantum-platform-with-rest-api}"
msgstr ""
"I-set up ang paggamit ng IBM Quantum Platform gamit ang REST API {#set-up-"
"to-use-ibm-quantum-platform-with-rest-api}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can access quantum processors with REST APIs, enabling you to work with "
"QPUs using any programming language or framework.\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari kang mag-access ng mga quantum processor gamit ang mga REST API, na "
"nagbibigay-daan sa iyo na makipagtulungan sa mga QPU gamit ang anumang "
"programming language o framework.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "1. Get access {#1-get-access}"
msgstr "1. Kumuha ng access {#1-get-access}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you do not already have a user account, get one at the [IBM Quantum login"
" page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/login).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung wala ka pang user account, gumawa ng isa sa [pahina ng IBM Quantum "
"login](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/login).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create an API key (also called a token) on the "
"[dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com). Note that the same API key can "
"be used for either region.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gumawa ng API key (tinatawag din na token) sa "
"[dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com). Tandaan na ang parehong API key "
"ay maaaring gamitin para sa alinmang rehiyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"1. Generate an IBM Cloud Identity and Access Management (IAM) bearer token. This is a short-lived token  used to authenticate requests to the REST API. To generate one, call the [IAM Identity Services API](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/iam-identity-token-api#create-api-key) as shown in the following sample request:\n"
"<Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"1. Gumawa ng IBM Cloud Identity and Access Management (IAM) bearer token. Ito ay isang panandaliang token na ginagamit para ma-authenticate ang mga kahilingan sa REST API. Para gumawa nito, tawagan ang [IAM Identity Services API](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/iam-identity-token-api#create-api-key) gaya ng ipinapakita sa sumusunod na halimbawang kahilingan:\n"
"<Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   <TabItem value=\"Curl\" label=\"Curl\">\n"
msgstr "   <TabItem value=\"Curl\" label=\"Curl\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   Expected Response\n"
msgstr "   Inaasahang Tugon\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   </TabItem>\n"
msgstr "   </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   <TabItem value=\"Python\" label=\"Python\">\n"
msgstr "   <TabItem value=\"Python\" label=\"Python\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"   </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2. Choose an authentication method {#2-choose-an-authentication-method}"
msgstr ""
"2. Pumili ng paraan ng pagpapatunay {#2-choose-an-authentication-method}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Choose the appropriate authentication method, depending on your working "
"environment:\n"
msgstr ""
"Pumili ng angkop na paraan ng pagpapatunay batay sa iyong kapaligiran sa "
"trabaho:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create an environment variable for your API key (trusted Python "
"environments)](#environment_variable)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Gumawa ng environment variable para sa iyong API key (mga "
"pinagkakatiwalaang Python na kapaligiran)](#environment_variable)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Use your API key directly (untrusted environment)](/guides/cloud-setup-"
"untrusted#rest-untrusted)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Gamitin nang direkta ang iyong API key (hindi pinagkakatiwalaang "
"kapaligiran)](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted#rest-untrusted)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"environment_variable\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"environment_variable\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create an environment variable (trusted environment) {#create-an-"
"environment-variable-trusted-environment}"
msgstr ""
"Gumawa ng environment variable (pinagkakatiwalaang kapaligiran) {#create-an-"
"environment-variable-trusted-environment}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To set the IQP_API_TOKEN environment variable in your system, you can add "
"the following line to your shell profile (for example, .bashrc or .zshrc) or"
" by setting it directly in your terminal:\n"
msgstr ""
"Para i-set ang IQP_API_TOKEN na environment variable sa iyong sistema, "
"maaari kang magdagdag ng sumusunod na linya sa iyong shell profile "
"(halimbawa, .bashrc o .zshrc) o i-set ito nang direkta sa iyong terminal:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```shell\n"
"    export IQP_API_TOKEN=<your-API_KEY> \n"
"    # Use the 44-character API_KEY you created and saved \n"
"    # from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard\n"
"    ```\n"
"    When you invoke the environment variable in your code, include `import os`, as in this example:\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```shell\n"
"    export IQP_API_TOKEN=<your-API_KEY> \n"
"    # Use the 44-character API_KEY you created and saved \n"
"    # from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Kapag ginagamit ang environment variable sa iyong code, isama ang `import os`, tulad ng sa halimbawang ito:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    import os\n"
"    api_token = os.environ['IQP_API_TOKEN']\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Note that when creating an environment variable, your API key is still stored locally in plain text, and should be safeguarded.\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    import os\n"
"    api_token = os.environ['IQP_API_TOKEN']\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Tandaan na kapag gumawa ng environment variable, ang iyong API key ay naka-imbak pa rin nang lokal sa plain text, at dapat itong pangalagaan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Authenticate requests to the Qiskit Runtime REST API by including the CRN "
"and bearer token to the request's headers.\n"
msgstr ""
"I-authenticate ang mga kahilingan sa Qiskit Runtime REST API sa pamamagitan "
"ng pagsasama ng CRN at bearer token sa mga header ng kahilingan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3. Optional: Configure your firewall {#3-optional-configure-your-firewall}"
msgstr ""
"3. Opsyonal: I-configure ang iyong firewall {#3-optional-configure-your-"
"firewall}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    If necessary, use [this information](/guides/quickstart-steps-"
"org#firewall) to enable access to the IBM Quantum API endpoints.\n"
msgstr ""
"    Kung kinakailangan, gamitin ang [impormasyong ito](/guides/quickstart-"
"steps-org#firewall) para paganahin ang access sa mga IBM Quantum API "
"endpoint.\n"

